Looking at this cluster, the shared signature is that the side to move has a *concrete tactical resource* (a sound capture, a fork/deflection, or a king boxed in) that a static classical eval flattens into "roughly balanced." To stay orthogonal to the existing library I avoid raw counts (which are already there) and instead encode the *soundness/value* of these motifs.

